{C:81901900}{C:81958296C01D00000000}I wonder if another war's going to start.

{C:81958296C11D00000000}The last great war only ended twenty years ago...

{x00}

{C:81901900}{C:81958296C31D00000000}I hear they're sending a Cloud Ship to take back the stolen ship.

{C:81958296C41D00000000}They're going out into the Cloud Sea for the first time, where nobody's ever crossed before. That's brave of them!




{x00}

{C:81900100}{C:81958296E71D00000000}Lun... Is she safe...? No! Of course she's safe. She has to be!

{C:81958296E81D00000000}All right! Hang on, Lun!! I'm going to get you out of there!!


{x00}

{C:81930000}{C:819782830300}Previously Visited Towns

Once you've entered a town's port, a town marker will appear on the radar.

For towns with these markers, open the menu with the Circle button and select the place name under 'Target Selection'.

A yellow target marker will then appear, showing that location.

Use the yellow target marker together with the blue guidance marker to help you navigate.{C:819782830000}



{x00}
